  "title": "Cremini Mushroom and Rice Soup",
  "description": "Hearty and thick, this easy mushroom soup with rice has a double dose of mushrooms--dried porcini and fresh cremini--which add a meaty texture and satisfying umami flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Katie Marr"
  ],
